      "id": "claim_dcf19291067e4928b3667ff08fadecef",
      "statement": "AIGateway.chat() is the governed chat-model boundary: when enabled it applies DLP, optional health rerouting, cache lookup, local rate and spend checks, transport routing, then success-only accounting/caching; when disabled it directly calls the requested provider without those middleware controls.",
